<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>User Data Deletion | Aaisaheb Business</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Request deletion of your personal data from Aaisaheb Business."
  >

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #7c3aed;
      --primary-dark: #5b21b6;
      --text: #1f2937;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --background: #f8fafc;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --border: #e5e7eb;
      --success: #166534;
      --success-bg: #f0fdf4;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--background);
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
      color: white;
      padding: 70px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 17px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(100% - 40px, 900px);
      margin: 40px auto;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 45px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .card h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .notice-box {
      background: #f5f3ff;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }

    .notice-box strong {
      color: #111827;
    }

    .success-box {
      background: var(--success-bg);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--success);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      color: var(--success);
    }

    form {
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: #111827;
    }

    input,
    textarea,
    select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-family: inherit;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      background: #fff;
    }

    input:focus,
    textarea:focus,
    select:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.12);
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 130px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .checkbox-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .checkbox-group input {
      width: auto;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .checkbox-group label {
      font-weight: normal;
      margin: 0;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    }

    button:hover {
      background: var(--primary-dark);
    }

    button:active {
      transform: scale(0.99);
    }

    .contact-box {
      background: #f5f3ff;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header {
        padding: 50px 20px;
      }

      header h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(100% - 24px, 900px);
        margin: 25px auto;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 25px 20px;
      }

      .card h2 {
        font-size: 21px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>User Data Deletion</h1>
    <p>Aaisaheb Business</p>
  </header>

  <main class="container">

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Request Deletion of Your Data</h2>

      <p>
        At <strong>Aaisaheb Business</strong>, we respect your privacy and
        provide you with the ability to request deletion of your personal
        information.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you would like us to delete your personal data from our systems,
        please submit the request form below.
      </p>

      <div class="notice-box">
        <strong>Please note:</strong>
        Some information may need to be retained where required by law,
        for legitimate business purposes, to complete transactions,
        resolve disputes, or protect against fraud and abuse.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Data Deletion Request</h2>

      <form
        action="YOUR_FORM_SUBMISSION_URL"
        method="POST"
      >

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Full Name</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="name"
            name="name"
            placeholder="Enter your full name"
            autocomplete="name"
            required
          >
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="Enter the email associated with your account"
            autocomplete="email"
            required
          >
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
          <input
            type="tel"
            id="phone"
            name="phone"
            placeholder="Enter your phone number"
            autocomplete="tel"
          >
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="request-type">Request Type</label>

          <select
            id="request-type"
            name="request_type"
            required
          >
            <option value="">Select an option</option>
            <option value="delete_all">
              Delete all personal data
            </option>
            <option value="delete_account">
              Delete my account
            </option>
            <option value="delete_specific">
              Delete specific information
            </option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="details">
            Additional Details
          </label>

          <textarea
            id="details"
            name="details"
            placeholder="Tell us if there is any specific data you would like us to delete."
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <input
            type="checkbox"
            id="confirmation"
            name="confirmation"
            value="yes"
            required
          >

          <label for="confirmation">
            I confirm that I am requesting the deletion of my own personal
            information and that the information provided in this request
            is accurate.
          </label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit">
          Submit Data Deletion Request
        </button>

      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>What Happens After You Submit?</h2>

      <p>
        After receiving your request, Aaisaheb Business may verify your
        identity to help prevent unauthorized deletion requests.
      </p>

      <p>
        Once verification is complete, we will review your request and
        take appropriate action in accordance with applicable laws and
        our data retention requirements.
      </p>

      <div class="success-box">
        We will use the contact information you provide to communicate
        with you about your deletion request when necessary.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Request by Email</h2>

      <p>
        You may also request deletion of your personal data by contacting us
        directly.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-box">
        <p><strong>Aaisaheb Business</strong></p>

        <p>
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">
            [Insert Business Email]
          </a>
        </p>

        <p>
          Phone: [Insert Phone Number]
        </p>

        <p>
          Address: [Insert Business Address]
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Related Policies</h2>

      <p>
        For more information about how we collect, use, and protect
        personal information, please review our
        <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can also review our
        <a href="terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>
      &copy; <span id="year"></span> Aaisaheb Business.
      All rights reserved.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
      <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
      &nbsp; | &nbsp;
      <a href="terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a>
      &nbsp; | &nbsp;
      <a href="user-data-deletion.html">User Data Deletion</a>
    </p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

</body>
</html>
